<!-- 免费体验：一个家庭一次免费基础测评（测完给报告和话术）、免费诊断会议、免费 3 节课。样式照「绑定家庭」（agent/bind-family）。 -->
<view class="ft-page">
  <view class="ft-ambient" aria-hidden="true"></view>
  <view class="ft-topbar">
    <view class="ft-topbar-inner" style="height: {{navigationBarHeight}}px; padding-top: {{statusBarHeight}}px;">
      <view class="ft-back" bindtap="handleBack" aria-label="返回" aria-role="button"><view class="ft-back-icon"></view></view>
      <text class="ft-topbar-title" style="top: {{statusBarHeight}}px; height: {{navigationBarHeight}}px; line-height: {{navigationBarHeight}}px;">免费体验</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <scroll-view class="ft-scroll" scroll-y show-scrollbar="{{false}}" style="padding-top: {{contentTop}}px;">
    <view class="ft-shell">
      <view wx:if="{{loadFailed}}" class="ft-card ft-state">
        <text class="ft-state-text">{{errorMessage}}</text>
        <view class="ft-button" bindtap="retry" aria-role="button">重新读取</view>
      </view>
      <block wx:elif="{{!loaded}}">
        <view class="ft-card"><view class="sk sk-line sk-mid"></view><view class="sk sk-line sk-short"></view></view>
        <view class="ft-card"><view class="sk sk-line"></view><view class="sk sk-line"></view><view class="sk ft-sk-block"></view></view>
        <view class="ft-card"><view class="sk sk-line sk-mid"></view><view class="sk ft-sk-block"></view></view>
      </block>
      <block wx:else>
        <view class="ft-card ft-family">
          <text class="ft-name">{{view.family.name}}</text>
          <text class="ft-sub">家长 ID {{view.family.publicId}} · 以下免费权益整个家庭合计一次</text>
        </view>

        <!-- ① 免费基础测评 -->
        <view class="ft-section">
          <view class="ft-heading"><text class="ft-no">1</text>免费基础测评</view>
          <view class="ft-card">
            <block wx:if="{{view.testState === 'none' || view.testState === 'waiting'}}">
              <view wx:if="{{view.testState === 'waiting'}}" class="ft-status"><text class="ft-dot is-wait"></text>{{view.testText}}：{{view.testChild.name}}</view>
              <text class="ft-tip" wx:if="{{view.testState === 'none'}}">选一个孩子开通。孩子先定学习目标，再围绕目标做一次基础测评（约 10～15 分钟），测完出报告和话术。</text>
              <view wx:if="{{view.testState === 'waiting'}}" class="ft-steps">
                <text>1. 打开孩子的知鹿学习小程序（没有微信的孩子用网页端）</text>
                <text>2. 点底栏「目标」，先设好学习目标</text>
                <text>3. 点开始测评，页面会显示「免费基础测评」</text>
              </view>
              <view wx:if="{{!view.children.length}}" class="ft-empty">这个家庭还没有绑定孩子。请家长先在小程序绑定孩子，或给孩子创建网页端账号。</view>
              <view wx:else class="ft-chips">
                <view wx:for="{{view.children}}" wx:key="studentProfileId" class="ft-chip {{pickedChild === item.studentProfileId ? 'is-on' : ''}}" bindtap="pickChild" data-id="{{item.studentProfileId}}" aria-role="radio" aria-checked="{{pickedChild === item.studentProfileId}}">{{item.label}}</view>
              </view>
              <view wx:if="{{view.children.length && (view.testState === 'none' || pickedChild !== view.testChild.studentProfileId)}}" class="ft-button ft-block {{opening ? 'is-disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="handleOpenTest" aria-role="button">{{opening ? '开通中…' : (view.testState === 'waiting' ? '换成这个孩子' : '开通免费测评')}}</view>
            </block>

            <block wx:elif="{{view.testState === 'testing' || view.testState === 'failed'}}">
              <view class="ft-status"><text class="ft-dot is-wait"></text>{{view.testText}}：{{view.testChild.name}}</view>
              <text class="ft-tip">{{view.testState === 'failed' ? '请让孩子在「目标」页点重新测评。' : '孩子测完后，这里会出报告和话术。'}}</text>
              <view class="ft-link" bindtap="load" aria-role="button">刷新</view>
            </block>

            <block wx:else>
              <view class="ft-status"><text class="ft-dot is-done"></text>{{view.testText}}：{{view.testChild.name}} · {{view.result.subjectName}}</view>
              <text class="ft-goal">目标：{{view.result.goal}}</text>
              <view class="ft-stats">
                <view><text class="ft-stat-num">{{view.result.tested}}</text><text class="ft-stat-label">已测知识点</text></view>
                <view><text class="ft-stat-num is-gray">{{view.result.untested}}</text><text class="ft-stat-label">未测知识点</text></view>
                <view><text class="ft-stat-num">{{view.result.rootGaps.length}}</text><text class="ft-stat-label">根源卡点</text></view>
              </view>
              <view wx:if="{{view.result.rootGaps.length}}" class="ft-gaps">
                <text wx:for="{{view.result.rootGaps}}" wx:key="*this" class="ft-gap">{{item}}</text>
              </view>
              <view class="ft-button ft-block {{reportLoading ? 'is-disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="handleReport" aria-role="button">{{reportLoading ? '正在生成报告…' : '查看 PDF 报告'}}</view>
            </block>
          </view>

          <view wx:if="{{view.testState === 'done'}}" class="ft-card">
            <view class="ft-card-title">跟家长讲的话术</view>
            <block wx:if="{{view.script}}">
              <text class="ft-script" user-select>{{view.script}}</text>
              <view class="ft-actions">
                <view class="ft-button ft-ghost {{scriptLoading ? 'is-disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="handleScript" data-regenerate="1" aria-role="button">{{scriptLoading ? '重新写…' : '重新写一段'}}</view>
                <view class="ft-button" bindtap="copyScript" aria-role="button">复制</view>
              </view>
            </block>
            <block wx:else>
              <text class="ft-tip">按孩子的测评结果写一段话，可以发给家长，也可以照着跟家长讲，最后邀请约诊断会议。</text>
              <view class="ft-button ft-block {{scriptLoading ? 'is-disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="handleScript" aria-role="button">{{scriptLoading ? '正在写…' : '生成话术'}}</view>
            </block>
            <text wx:if="{{scriptError}}" class="ft-error">{{scriptError}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>

        <!-- ② 免费诊断会议 -->
        <view class="ft-section">
          <view class="ft-heading"><text class="ft-no">2</text>免费诊断会议</view>
          <view class="ft-card">
            <block wx:if="{{view.meeting.status === 'none'}}">
              <text class="ft-tip">老师和孩子一起把卡点确认一遍，定一个分步补的方案。选好给哪个孩子约，写上方便的时间和想解决的问题，提交后服务老师会接单。</text>
              <view wx:if="{{!view.children.length}}" class="ft-empty">这个家庭还没有绑定孩子。请家长先在小程序绑定孩子，或给孩子创建网页端账号，再来申请。</view>
              <view wx:else class="ft-chips">
                <view wx:for="{{view.children}}" wx:key="studentProfileId" class="ft-chip {{meetingChild === item.studentProfileId ? 'is-on' : ''}}" bindtap="pickMeetingChild" data-id="{{item.studentProfileId}}" aria-role="radio" aria-checked="{{meetingChild === item.studentProfileId}}">{{item.label}}</view>
              </view>
              <textarea class="ft-textarea" maxlength="300" value="{{meetingNote}}" placeholder="例如：周六上午方便，想解决分数计算老出错" placeholder-class="ft-placeholder" bindinput="handleMeetingInput" disabled="{{meetingSubmitting}}" auto-height />
              <view class="ft-button ft-block {{meetingSubmitting || !view.children.length ? 'is-disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="handleMeeting" aria-role="button">{{meetingSubmitting ? '提交中…' : '申请免费诊断会议'}}</view>
            </block>
            <block wx:else>
              <view class="ft-status"><text class="ft-dot {{view.meeting.status === 'arranged' ? 'is-done' : 'is-wait'}}"></text>{{view.meetingText}}</view>
              <text wx:if="{{view.meetingChildText}}" class="ft-tip">孩子：{{view.meetingChildText}}</text>
              <text class="ft-tip">申请时写的：{{view.meeting.note}}</text>
              <text wx:if="{{view.meeting.adminNote}}" class="ft-tip">平台说明：{{view.meeting.adminNote}}</text>
            </block>
          </view>
        </view>

        <!-- ③ 免费定制课程 -->
        <view class="ft-section">
          <view class="ft-heading"><text class="ft-no">3</text>免费定制课程</view>
          <view class="ft-card">
            <view class="ft-status"><text class="ft-dot {{view.lessons.used >= view.lessons.limit ? 'is-done' : 'is-wait'}}"></text>已用 {{view.lessons.used}} / {{view.lessons.limit}} 节</view>
            <text class="ft-tip">没开会员时，诊断会议里老师定的课，前 {{view.lessons.limit}} 节免费生成（全家合计）；开通会员后按积分扣。</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </block>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
</view>
<dev-reset-fab />
